# SleepBot environment variables.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in as needed. Phase 1 (Sleeper read-only) needs NONE
# of these — the public Sleeper API requires no auth. They are placeholders for
# later phases so the `env:VAR_NAME` config indirection has something to resolve.

# --- Phase 4: ESPN adapter (cookie-based private API) ---
# ESPN_SWID=
# ESPN_S2=

# --- Phase 2: Sleeper write actions (unofficial, session-based) ---
# SLEEPER_SESSION_TOKEN=
